### CREATE A NEW ORGANIZATION
POST http://localhost:3900/api/organizations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Acme School",
  "slug": "acme" 
}

### GET ALL ORGANIZATIONS
GET http://localhost:3900/api/organizations

### GET A ORGANIZATION BY ID
GET http://localhost:3900/api/organizations/7566502f-082a-44e1-b95b-3e08cfa5b68b

### UPDATE A ORGANIZATION (partial — name, domain, status)
PATCH http://localhost:3900/api/organizations/7566502f-082a-44e1-b95b-3e08cfa5b68b
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Acme Corporation Ltd",
  "domain": "acme.example.com",
  "status": "active"
}

### DELETE A ORGANIZATION
DELETE http://localhost:3900/api/organizations/7566502f-082a-44e1-b95b-3e08cfa5b68b
### --- Custom domains (Settings → Domain), as a school admin ---

### List the school's domains (each carries the DNS records to create)
GET http://localhost:3900/api/domains
x-tenant-id: acme
Authorization: Bearer <tenant-jwt>

### Add a domain (starts pending)
POST http://localhost:3900/api/domains
x-tenant-id: acme
Authorization: Bearer <tenant-jwt>
Content-Type: application/json

{ "hostname": "erp.acme-scl.com" }

### Check the DNS records now (verifies when both pass)
POST http://localhost:3900/api/domains/<domain-id>/verify
x-tenant-id: acme
Authorization: Bearer <tenant-jwt>

### Make a verified domain primary
POST http://localhost:3900/api/domains/<domain-id>/primary
x-tenant-id: acme
Authorization: Bearer <tenant-jwt>

### Remove a domain
DELETE http://localhost:3900/api/domains/<domain-id>
x-tenant-id: acme
Authorization: Bearer <tenant-jwt>

### TLS "ask" endpoint for Caddy on-demand TLS (public)
GET http://localhost:3900/api/public/organizations/tls-check?domain=erp.acme-scl.com
